Nova-App: Nova Disk
Nova-News: Neu in NovaOS 2: Festplattenanalyse und Datenrettung
Nova-News-En: New in NovaOS 2: disk analysis and file rescue
Description: Nova Disk - disk analysis and file rescue (NovaOS 2)
 See how full every drive is and whether it is healthy (SMART), what fills the
 disk (biggest folders, file types, largest files), restore files from the
 trash, and rescue deleted photos, videos and documents from USB sticks, memory
 cards and disks with PhotoRec - read-only, saved onto another drive.
